    {
      "id": "4.57.3",
      "label": "4.57.3",
      "numbers": [
        3
      ],
      "devanagari": "सर्वथा प्रायम् आसीनान् यदि नः भक्षयिष्यति |\nकृत कृत्या भविष्यामः क्षिप्रम् सिद्धिम् इतो गताः",
      "iast": "sarvathā prāyam āsīnān yadi naḥ bhakṣayiṣyati |\nkṛta kṛtyā bhaviṣyāmaḥ kṣipram siddhim ito gatāḥ",
      "translation": "\"We are sitting for fast-unto-death and if that eagle wishes eat us let it be so... then our deliverance will be achieved in anyway and we will go to heaven from here...\" Thus, some other monkeys gave thought to lower that eagle down.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
