      "label": "4.57.5, 6",
      "numbers": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "devanagari": "बभूवुः ऋक्षरजो नाम वानरेन्द्रः प्रतापवान् |\nमम आर्यः पार्थिवः पक्षिन् धार्मिकौ तस्य च आत्मजौ\nसुग्रीवः चैव वली च पुत्रौ घन बलौ उभौ |\nलोके विश्रुत कर्मा अभूत् राजा वाली पिता मम",
      "iast": "babhūvuḥ ṛkṣarajo nāma vānarendraḥ pratāpavān |\nmama āryaḥ pārthivaḥ pakṣin dhārmikau tasya ca ātmajau\nsugrīvaḥ caiva valī ca putrau ghana balau ubhau |\nloke viśruta karmā abhūt rājā vālī pitā mama",
      "translation": "\"Oh, bird, my noble grandfather is known as Rikshaja who was a valorous and an outstanding monkey among all monkeys, was the king of monkeys. He has two generous and great mighty sons namely Vali and Sugreeva. My father Vali was highly renowned in the world for his bold acts, and he became the king later to my grandfather...",
